printer-driver-aimotech (0.3.5) unstable; urgency=low

  * Advertise dash-separated MAC hosts (aimotech://AA-BB-CC-DD-EE-FF).
    CUPS httpSeparateURI treats colon octets as a port, so lpadmin
    rejects colon-form URIs. Backend still parses colon, dash, and
    12-hex forms; RFCOMM uses colon MACs.

 -- remote_codes pack <remote-codes@example.com>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

printer-driver-aimotech (0.3.4) unstable; urgency=low

  * CUPS driver for Aimotech D30 / Print Master RFCOMM ESC/POS GS v 0.
  * drv + PPD so lpinfo -m, GNOME, KDE, system-config-printer, and the
    CUPS web UI list the printer.
  * Backend discovers live BlueZ names (D30 / Print Master / Phomemo /
    Quin; never nelko/p21 or ogrphy/jbd).
  * aimotech-setup-printer for the lpadmin group. lp/lpr needs no root.
  * Handshake 1F 11 38/12/13/07 then ESC @ / GS v 0 / ESC d 23.

 -- remote_codes pack <remote-codes@example.com>  Sat, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
